#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"How to use Directed Acyclic Graphs (DAGs) to analyze and transform quantum "
"circuits in Qiskit transpiler passes"
msgstr ""
"Comment utiliser les graphes acycliques orientés (DAGs) pour analyser et "
"transformer des circuits quantiques dans les passes du transpileur Qiskit"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Work with DAGs in transpiler passes"
msgstr "Travailler avec les DAGs dans les passes du transpileur"

